-# Check current state
-du -sh ~/.claude/projects/*/
-
-# Archive old conversations (>14 days)
-claude-history-rotate.sh --days 14 --dry-run  # Preview
-claude-history-rotate.sh --days 14            # Execute
-```
-
-**Monthly Cleanup** (1st of month):
-```bash
