-## Troubleshooting
-
-For troubleshooting help, see:
-- [Common Issues](../Reference/common-issues.md) - Quick fixes for frequent problems
-- [Troubleshooting Guide](../Reference/troubleshooting.md) - Comprehensive problem resolution
